WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.262
Translate fractions, decimals and percentages into a common representation before

00:00:05.262 --> 00:00:05.768
comparing.

00:00:06.617 --> 00:00:13.231
Express 2/5 as a decimal. The answer is 0.4. Calculate numerator divided by

00:00:13.231 --> 00:00:16.793
denominator: 2 divided by 5 equals 0.4.

00:00:17.617 --> 00:00:23.206
A learner at a school fair has completed 3/10 of a project. What percentage is equal

00:00:23.206 --> 00:00:26.001
to that fraction? Pause to choose and explain.

00:00:26.867 --> 00:00:33.386
A learner at a school fair has completed 3/10 of a project. What percentage is equal

00:00:33.386 --> 00:00:39.091
to that fraction? The answer is 30 percent. 3/10 equals 0.3 equals 30 percent.
